    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:3a331f6a063db348",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "629c457f2ccf8090d854b4d24d5c47d9d39f9ccb34fe87f1cce0661b0ed3fd21",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Free days for independent walks or optional excursions\n\nRio does not feel like a conventional city laid out in a regular grid. Streets curve around rocky hills, neighbourhoods stretch along beaches, and forest greenery reaches into the urban areas. You can spend a free day without an organised excursion, choosing beaches, cafés and neighbourhoods as you go.\n\nYou can also choose from these optional activities:\n\n**Trip to tropical islands**\n\nOptional\n\n**Rio by Night: Mulatto Show**\n\nOptional\n\n**Duration:** about 4 hours.\n\n**Helicopter flight over Rio**\n\nOptional\n\nOptions lasting **6 to 13 minutes** are available.\n\n**Master class on making a local cocktail Caipirinha.**\n\nOptional\n\n**Master class on cooking Brazilian shurasco  **\n\nOptional\n\n**Botanical Garden**\n\nOptional\n\n**Duration:** about 4 hours.\n\n**Trekking to Sugarloaf**\n\nOptional",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw5dsin2-amanda",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The Word contains the optional activity names, but not the current RU city-layout paragraph or the 6–13 minute helicopter variants (Word describes 10–30 minutes). Preserve the assigned RU variants and durations without changing the itinerary.",
