    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "deecbf9543891976cefe20f22303ce3d2cf9e6ba13ac24e546c2dd8e06603496",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. At the appointed time, transfer to Rio de Janeiro airport for your flight to Foz do Iguaçu. Upon arrival, meeting with the guide and transfer to the hotel. \n\nAfter Rio, the landscape changes completely: instead of the ocean and mountains, you are surrounded by tropical forest and a broad river that splits into hundreds of torrents at the edge of the falls.\n\nWe recommend dining at the Itaipu restaurant at the Belmond das Catartas Hotel (Brazilian cuisine, European cuisine) ",
